3. She refers to herself as "reliable," albeit with a self-aware twist due to her procrastination habits. (Verbatim: "Good old reliable, Elia, to always be there eventually, even if she's late.")
4. She keeps backups of important streaming files, such as her BGM, and organizes them in labeled folders. (Verbatim: "I actually do have a folder called OBS stream and it's actually got everything in it.")
