9. She jokingly claims to be skilled at avoiding detection, referencing a fictional persona of evading authorities. (Verbatim: "I have no idea. Could you tell us what the plan is? I need to decide if it's worth over studying.")
10. She values her viewers deeply and emphasizes their worth, often expressing love and appreciation. (Verbatim: "Ellia sending you love as you need to know how precious you are to all of us, you are amazing.") [end of text]



